properties of the program `{{ program }}`:

{% for prop in properties %}
<{{ prop.sort }}>
  Property {{ loop.index }} (`{{ prop.title }}`): {{ prop.description }}
  {% if prop.sort == "attack_vector" %}
  Goal: demonstrate that this attack cannot occur. If it *can*, the rule that shows it must fail —
